			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Coincidentally, <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>slightlyoff</span></a></span> recently linked to this blog post, which describes the method. As for a name? What about “Progressive Design System”?</p><p><a href=\"https://blog.almaer.com/building-a-modern-design-system-in-layers/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">blog.almaer.com/building-a-mod</span><span class=\"invisible\">ern-design-system-in-layers/</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
